The Holy Mass for release and healing celebrated by Father Witko attracts crowds
The parents of a 7-month-natured child came to him, who had a 7.5 mm-sized hole in his heart.
It's supposed to be in surgery.
Father Józef Witko was praying over him.
On the same day, the boy was taken to the hospital for surgery.
Suspicuous doctors said: “Operation is not necessary, the cavity is only 1.5 mm.”
My parents cried with happiness.
After another prayer the Franciscan, the hole was completely gone.
The clergyman began to experience the extraordinary actions of the Creator already as a teenager.
Purgatory in his dreams came to him with a request for help.
“I’ve been woken up at night and urged to be praying for the dead and those who were dying at that moment.
He also experienced the presence of an evil spirit.
He had a vision of what was happening to a man who commits mortal sin.
“My body began to change.
“I’ve lost the human qualities and I’ve started to take on the appearance of an animal,” she says.
Invisible force lifted him up, he couldn’t get his voice out.
He felt he was lost.
And then God gave him salvation.
“Deminted in the waters of a river symbolizing a holy Baptism, I was liberated and I went back to a human form.”
He didn’t tell anyone about these strange experiences.
His vocation matured in it.
He was 16 when he joined the Franciscans.
In servions, he didn’t just want to talk about Jesus.
He wanted people to experience him alive.
Members of the Charismatic Community of Renewal in the Sacred Spirit
A lot of people who are counted to get rid of the disease for the healing celebrated by Witko’s father are involved.
