MAXIPIZZZZA: Signing an agreement with an auditor for the audit of financial statements for the years 2019, 2020 and 2021.
The Management Board of Maxipizza S.A. informs that on September 27, 2019 it has signed an agreement with Premium Audyt Spółka z o.o. with its registered office in Poznań at Czartoria 1/1, signed under KRS number 0000540136 into the Register of Entrepreneurs of the National Court Register maintained by the District Court of Poznań – Nowe Miasto and Wilda in Poznań, 8th Commercial Division of the National Court Register, entered on the list of entities authorized to audit financial statements.
The subject of the agreement is the audit of the financial statements of Maxipizza S.A. for the following financial years: a. from 1 January 2019 to 31 December 2019, b. from 1 January 2020 to 31 December 2020, c. from 1 January 2021 to 31 December 2021.
