It went high, it fell low
Marian Banaś is the New President of the Verkhovnast Chamber of In-sufficipating.
This position was established on August 30, 2019, for a 6-year term.
His candidacy has been reported by the Law and Justice and adopted by the party’s politicians.
Previously, Banaś was associated with NIK from 1992 to 2005, he acted as a collaborator of Lech Kaczyński.
During the first Pi-S World Governments (2005-2008), Banaś held the position of President of the Customs Service, as well as Undersecretary of State in the Ministry of Finance.
Since 2015, he has relocated the Head of the Customs Service at the stool, and since 2017 he has managed the National Revenue Administration.
For 3 months, Banaś held the position of Minister of Finance in Mateusz Morawiecki’s government.
